Subject: [PATCH 18/18] mctpreactor: Support configuration for USB MCTP devices

Changes for MCTPUSBDevice reactor with schema defined in mctp.json[1]

Tested
'''
On gb200nvl-obmc machine, the mctpreactor is able to read the exposed EM config and populate the EID properly for usb devices.
'''
'''
MCTP over USB enumeration on Alon8 via this + [2].
'''
[1](https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/77381)
[2](https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/85991)

